<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-14T19:23:12.772Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 19:23:12 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese army has seized Bakori and Sali and recaptured Al-Khuwai in West and North Kordofan, while the RSF continues drone strikes that killed nine civilians in the Blue Nile and had a drone shot down after crossing from Ethiopia. RSF forces killed ten civilians in West Kordofan city An-Nuhud, according to a relief group. Gold smuggled from Sudan is being routed through Ethiopia to the UAE, which remains the main destination for the illicit metal. Turkish support for the SAF is linked to ports, minerals and military bases. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOWXVTdmpMaE8xQjVDejhla3FQS3JuR1NjaW1TeGswMGlvVkpwNFRMVTliLWV6TG9zWk1DN1Z0b2NSQUpwYkNfMEJ4dW9jdWJWX0JvbVp6VFI0eHZWYjNDZEJvaXZ0UURXN3lUV216aWJBeHJIelh0WEhEam9QM2cwdXB0c3BzRVhNdVR3dkxMWTMtalR3amVUNE5UMk9mbTA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE9Sb255ek9CX0dfdjdIWUNqWDNzbUFKYWVjV1BQcDhXYXRkMV9kcjlaRG9EMGx1bWtBS1M4RmJCNW00N0d3MmJNa19DTm51S3c3cmZsLUVMcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE9ReFZWY0o0aTVKZFIxaXFpTDZxcGhMbk1SQW9ZT3kyZHNLRlMxM0dOeDNaQmxKQ1JBc25sUTg4VDJPajUtbWJPcXk4Zk1EWnlY?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxOS0NBVVAxQmUxQW5KWk54Nzh4Qkd1ejY3VmhDWk9VbTVuU3oyQ2hqNWZ2Um15ekh6SE9Del9XTzNZcFk2UHlhV3JVdzVQczVjeHFnbnBRbXp0VWlkT1FBQU53V1I1OW9NWHA3OEV0Nl9oQnlqWUM2anB4SjBab19Xc1hEYlRBM1IwdExBUURWNkpIQ2FxTUpoSkNTdVZjZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudans Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV9